  "about_editorial": {
    "story_label": "OUR STORY",
    "story_heading": "GLORAC was born from a love of quiet beauty.",
    "story_subheading": "The kind that does not need to announce itself.",
    "story_quote": "Luxury, to us, is not excess. It is how something feels.",
    "philosophy_label": "OUR PHILOSOPHY",
    "philosophy_heading": "Quiet Luxury",
    "philosophy_quote": "Never overstated. Always considered.",
    "craft_heading": "MADE WITH INTENTION",
    "craft_button": "DISCOVER OUR SILK",
    "closing_heading": "For the beautiful moments in between.",
    "closing_text": "Pieces designed for the way you live, rest, travel and celebrate.",
    "closing_button": "DISCOVER GLORAC",
    "captions": {
      "finest_fabrics": "THE FINEST FABRICS",
      "refined_details": "REFINED DETAILS",
      "considered_design": "CONSIDERED DESIGN",
      "lasting_beauty": "LASTING BEAUTY"
    },
    "story_text_html": "<p>We believe the pieces closest to the body should feel as beautiful as they look. From fluid silk sleepwear to softly feminine dresses and scarves, every GLORAC piece is created around ease, elegance and the simple pleasure of feeling beautifully dressed. Our collections are inspired by the quieter moments of life — slow mornings, evenings at home, journeys away, and occasions remembered long after they have passed.</p>",
    "philosophy_text_html": "<p>We are drawn to things that reveal their beauty slowly — natural movement, beautiful fabrics, thoughtful proportions and details that never ask for attention. GLORAC is designed for a woman who values how something feels as much as how it looks. Effortless at home. Elegant beyond it.</p>",
    "craft_text_html": "<p>From the drape of silk to the finish of a seam, every detail matters. We choose fabrics for their touch, movement and lasting beauty, then refine every silhouette so that it feels natural against the body.</p>"
  },
